{"id":3253,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>近日，2026第二届全国青少年智能无人系统应用大赛在上海举办，赛事配套高校成果展同步开展。我校航空宇航学院携多项自研成果亮相展会，核心展品JZ-120无人直升机吸引与会领导、行业媒体以及各参展单位广泛关注，充分展现学院在智能无人系统方向的科研实力与育人成效，有力支撑学院学科高质量建设。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=noRCSYLR-iolL8MzRNaUmCbnzlaL4flRn7nRM4Q7Mz7PolU0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyPLkybokybU8lPUNLaUmW7UN74nm-aM7MVnll4MRCbLzAFL4r7M7M7UNQFLNCiMm7Jv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLmCsgtA8pUrcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12267&e=.png\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E10989CE1BC0B2DBA3F204CEEE346918/35D4CDBF/2F561\" vheight=\"250.52999877929688\" vwidth=\"360.2699890136719\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=noRCSYLR-iolL8MzRNaUmCbnzlaL4flRn7nRM4Q7Mz7PolU0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyPLkybokybU8lPUNLaUmW7UN74nm-aM7MVnll4MRCbLzAFL4r7M7M7UNQFLNCiMm7Jv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLmCsgtA8pUrcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12267&e=.png\"></p><p>JZ-120中型无人直升机面向应急搜救、物资投送、大范围环境巡检等工程需求开展总体设计，具备有效载荷大、复杂环境适应性强、飞行可靠性高等特点。研发团队依托航空宇航学科积淀，在飞行器总体构型、飞控算法开发、动力系统匹配等关键技术上持续攻关，是学院科教融合、产学研协同创新的标志性成果。展会现场，学院师生向到访领导与媒体详细讲解JZ-120无人直升机的技术优势、研发历程和产业化应用前景，认真解答技术相关问题，得到参观领导的充分肯定。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nL4rS7ozlPU8L4Lz4NDoRWknzVfM4UlDMzCDU4GZUl7inNL0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyZn1hRMSybMm9sozLYMlUYnRVVLz-sM7CbUlLYLmVRLzVFLzMRoR9bL7nFLzVVUN-JqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLm-DMYbw62r8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12267&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/08FC596879325D2D1E1274F9AC221C11/13C8890D/11EBB\" vheight=\"245.3300018310547\" vwidth=\"327.20001220703125\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nL4rS7ozlPU8L4Lz4NDoRWknzVfM4UlDMzCDU4GZUl7inNL0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyZn1hRMSybMm9sozLYMlUYnRVVLz-sM7CbUlLYLmVRLzVFLzMRoR9bL7nFLzVVUN-JqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLm-DMYbw62r8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12267&e=.jpeg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nUllSYM47aMR9bLzRMRLNr7Ml-io7UlsUNVRL4lDUmQfUmN0gihFp2hmCIa0nShkoky8MkhVo7WVM7UZozW7LNnfUmUYM7n7MzWRU8lsMNVFUlLbL8LDLRVFn7lYnkb/v2rjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLmCsgtA8pUrcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12267&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/EB844E8BE4D892D2DAB424DD52CCE76A/AC93C601/DE2D\" vheight=\"245.07000732421875\" vwidth=\"326.79998779296875\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nUllSYM47aMR9bLzRMRLNr7Ml-io7UlsUNVRL4lDUmQfUmN0gihFp2hmCIa0nShkoky8MkhVo7WVM7UZozW7LNnfUmUYM7n7MzWRU8lsMNVFUlLbL8LDLRVFn7lYnkb/v2rjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLmCsgtA8pUrcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12267&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>本次参展，学校还同步展出黑匣子、蝴蝶刀无人机，并推出VR校史沉浸式体验项目，展示学校在航空安全记录装置、特种小型无人机研发、数字化文化建设等方向的研究成果，丰富参展成果体系。</p><p>展会现场，各级领导、行业媒体陆续莅临我院展位参观指导，到访展位参观指导，围绕无人系统技术发展、创新人才培养等与师生开展交流，不少参观者实地观摩装备实物、体验 VR 项目，近距离感受航空领域创新成果。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nozMSRLRCaM8nRLzR6RM4ffUl-YUmvliL7QfUzN8Ll-ZMm70gihFp2hmCIa0MSy8LkyaMYybL8V2L49DUzvaUlLaLRGYnRrfo7lZnmVkMmMFLNL8UmCZUlrFLz7ZM7lJqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLm-DMYbw62r8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12267&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/5400793AF386A70AC0002D5A8E8F1B63/2C4B68AE/1184E\" vheight=\"263.3299865722656\" vwidth=\"351.2699890136719\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nozMSRLRCaM8nRLzR6RM4ffUl-YUmvliL7QfUzN8Ll-ZMm70gihFp2hmCIa0MSy8LkyaMYybL8V2L49DUzvaUlLaLRGYnRrfo7lZnmVkMmMFLNL8UmCZUlrFLz7ZM7lJqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLm-DMYbw62r8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12267&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>此次参展是学院对外展示学科建设成果的重要平台，下一步，学院将持续深耕航空宇航学科领域，聚焦智能无人系统前沿方向，坚持科技创新与人才培养深度融合，借助赛事、科技成果展会等平台提升师生创新实践能力，完善学科建设体系，持续产出更多高质量科研成果，稳步提升学科特色与行业影响力。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=noRCSYLR-iolL8MzRNaUmCbnzlaL4flRn7nRM4Q7Mz7PolU0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyPLkybokybU8lPUNLaUmW7UN74nm-aM7MVnll4MRCbLzAFL4r7M7M7UNQFLNCiMm7Jv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47YLmCsgtA8pUrcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=12267&e=.png"}